# WASM Bindings

`evtx-viewer/src/wasm/` is generated by `wasm-pack` from `evtx-wasm/src/lib.rs`: never edit it.
After changing the `#[wasm_bindgen]` interface, rebuild with `./run_viewer.sh` from the
repository root. `chunk_arrow_ipc` batches are inserted into DuckDB by column position, so the
Arrow columns must stay in `LOGS_TABLE_SQL` order (`evtx-viewer/src/lib/duckdb.ts`).
